s","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"4WdDY97x4GdMYtyk1KQMnw","review_id":"cET116GDCAOKEUJnhEvRCg","date":"2016-01-07T19:01:00","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9535058736801147,"text_excerpt":"This is my favorite pho in the city. Now that winter is finally here, I find myself eating way more of the stuff. My go to here is the rare flank & brisket pho. Their broth is slightly sweeter than others but not in a weird way; the beef flavor stands out in an extraordinary way. They are way more generous with the meat than lots of other places. I also love that they let you add quail eggs to your pho, that's not something I've seen anywhere else in the NOLA metro. They also have iced chrysanthemum tea, which has the perfect floral taste and just the right amount of sweetness. The service is always great and they remember you if you're even semi-regular. I drive past at least three other..."},{"business_id":"4WdDY97x4GdMYtyk1KQMnw","review_id":"7IL4rmUBZw0Y-06dfpz2bg","date":"2017-07-23T03:54:17","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9487338066101074,"text_excerpt":"Tonight was my first time dining at Lilly's and it did not disappoint! I had been waiting to go here for a long time due to good reviews but I kept forgetting every time I was uptown. I wasn't feeling well earlier with my allergies acting up and a headache, so I suggested Vietnamese for dinner, specifically Lilly's. My fiancé happily obliged. We ordered an order of Lilly's spring rolls, com thit nuong (rice entree with grilled pork) and the vegetarian pho with tofu and veggies. Everything was delicious! I especially enjoyed the spring rolls because they were stuffed with shrimp, vermicelli, avocados and strawberries. Spring rolls typically don't contain avocado or fruit but this was a ver..."},{"business_id":"4WdDY97x4GdMYtyk1KQMnw","review_id":"-O2N43-vkcb2ee_2-dVFvA","date":"2015-12-24T02:24:48","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9478850364685059,"text_excerpt":"I'm a big fan of this cuisine. This is the first visit for this place and it definitely won't be my last. I have to come back a few more times and try some more before I give anyone 5 stars but this may be a done deal for me. The Pho Ga here is one of the best I have ever had. Their use of aromatics and warm spices was really brilliant. The staff was friendly, the prices fair and the space was really nice. I would like to order some Bun and some appetizers next time. If you like Vietnamese, you should definitely try Lilly's Cafe!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"4WdDY97x4GdMYtyk1KQMnw","photo_id":"4g96R3NIwW93S8d3NXXjdQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/4g96R3NIwW93S8d3NXXjdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8522374033927917},{"business_id":"4WdDY97x4GdMYtyk1KQMnw","photo_id":"YxG_yMLw2K9TkJdFicgb5g","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/YxG_yMLw2K9TkJdFicgb5g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8316437005996704},{"business_id":"4WdDY97x4GdMYtyk1KQMnw","photo_id":"_DLcyxJ-ejoMDvXhhlgBQw","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/_DLcyxJ-ejoMDvXhhlgBQw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7982242107391357},{"business_id":"4WdDY97x4GdMYtyk1KQMnw","photo_id":"Chnb2go5fNzAKozupD3DAA","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/Chnb2go5fNzAKozupD3DAA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.765018165